### Project Structure Overview

#### Core Configuration
- [package.json](mdc:package.json): Main project configuration with dependencies
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) includes [tsconfig.app.json](mdc:tsconfig.app.json) and [tsconfig.node.json](mdc:tsconfig.node.json): TypeScript configuration files
- [vite.config.ts](mdc:vite.config.ts): Vite build tool configuration
- [.env.template](mdc:.env.template): Template environment configuration files

#### Linting & Formatting
- [eslint.config.mjs](mdc:eslint.config.mjs): ESLint configuration
- [.prettierrc](mdc:.prettierrc): Prettier configuration
- [.commitlintrc](mdc:.commitlintrc): Commit message linting
- `.husky/`: Git hooks
- `.lintstagedrc`: Lint-staged config

#### Source Code Organization (`src/`)
- `assets/`: Static assets (CSS, images, fonts)
  - `images/`: Images
  - `css/`: CSS files
    - [main.css](mdc:src/assets/css/main.css): Main CSS file. Tailwind CSS is used.
- `components/`: UI components (atomic design structure)
  - `atoms/`: Basic components
  - `molecules/`: Composite components
  - `organisms/`: Complex components
  - `templates/`: Page templates
- `hooks/`: Custom React hooks
- `layouts/`: Application layouts
- `lib/`: Utility functions
- `locales/`: Internationalization files
  - `en.json`: English translation
  - `ja.json`: Japanese translation
  - `kr.json`: Korean translation (default)
- `models/`: Type definitions for API responses
- `pages/`: Page components
- `routes/`: Routing configuration
  - `[resource].ts`: Routing configuration for the resource
- `services/`: API services (RTK Query)
- `store/`: Redux store
  - `[resource]/`: Redux resource files
    - `[resource].selector.ts`: Redux selectors
    - `[resource].slice.ts`: Redux slices
- `sockets/`
  - [base.ts](mdc:src/sockets/base.ts): WebSocket configuration

#### Development Tools
- `.storybook/`: Storybook configuration
- `.vscode/`: VS Code settings

### Key Practices
- Use `@/` path alias for imports
- Follow atomic design principles for components
- Use RTK Query for API calls
- Implement internationalization with i18next. Always define in [kr.json](mdc:src/locales/kr.json) and use it in component
- Validate forms with react-hook-form and write custom hooks for each form
- Define new config Tailwind CSS in [main.css](mdc:src/assets/css/main.css)
- Do not fix linter errors
